# Customer Samsung launcher icon lock

The Customer app on Samsung (`com.onecab.customer`) must keep the iOS customer mark filling the circle: whole ONE/CAB and green border, letters uncut.

## Never

- Swap the launcher to the tiny notification brand mark (`onecab_notification_brand_mark`)
- Pad the mark down so the home icon looks tiny
- Full-bleed it so the circle crops the letters
- Rebuild or reinstall a customer APK that replaces `mipmap/ic_launcher*`
- Run Expo prebuild that regenerates those mipmaps

Source of truth is the locked files in `onecab-customer-native` (`assets/images/android-icon-foreground.png` and `android/app/src/main/res/mipmap-*/ic_launcher*.png`). Lock test: `src/shared/lib/androidLauncherIconLock.test.ts`.

**If the test fails, restore those files. Never delete or soften the lock.**
